{
    "title": "Photo Collage - Pic Grid Maker",
    "description": "Magic Photo Collage - CollageArt helps you create cool, beautiful, and stunning collage art and grids. \r\n\r\nCollageArt is a great collage maker and simplified tool used for editing pictures. After selecting some photos from your device, you can explore its amazing layouts, poster templates, stickers, and frames to edit and remix your pictures into photo collage without struggle.  \r\nIt offers 1000+ choices in layouts, frames, backgrounds, templates, stickers, filters, doodles & text fonts to help you create unique and awesome collages and grids. With this collage maker and photo editor, you can create amazing scenes and bring memories together, like holidays, weddings, graduations, baby showers, and more with this photo editor.\r\n\r\nYou can...      \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>Create your dream designs in simple taps</b>\r\nAlways designed with you in mind. Simplicity is one of its strengths. It makes editing easier with simple taps. It is easy to understand and create the magic you want without stress.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc50 <b>500+ layouts to choose from</b>\r\nChoose your favorite layout from numerous layouts, and create photo collage with one-tap. You can easily adjust the layout's margins, borders, and background style. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 <b>Amazing and Distinct Templates</b>\r\nExplore 600+ distinct design templates. These templates include Love, Family, Magazine, Holiday, etc. They come in trendy and catchy designs that can be shared on Insta stories, Snapchat or WhatsApp statuses for views.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd70 <b>Interesting and lively Stickers</b>\r\nCollageArt provides you with 500+ cute and interesting stickers that meet your moods and expressions. The love, heart, pet, flower, holiday, makeup, etc., stickers can enhance and make your pictures lively.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Astonishing Backgrounds & Patterns</b>\r\nBesides choosing the desired layout, you can add classy backgrounds to your design. These backgrounds come in solid color, blur, and gradient. Try these backgrounds and create stunning designs.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Apply desirable and realistic Filter effects</b>\r\nChoosing from numerous filter effects to enhance your photo. You can make adjustments to these effects in style and color. These incredible filter effects make your photo collage realistic and great.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 <b>Create cool Doodles</b>\r\nCreate interesting Doodles with us in simple taps. You can add text with your own handwriting and style. You can also draw shapes of your choice, like love, heart, etc using this collage maker and photo editor. Yes! You have that freedom and flexibility.\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f <b>High resolution and flexible formats</b>\r\nDesigns can be displayed in multiple ratios (1:1, 3:4, 5:4, 9:16) in HD. These ratios make it easy to share on any social media platform like Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat, TikTok, WhatsApp, Twitter, etc., or use as wallpapers and screensavers.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Freedom and flexibility to create</b>\r\nAlso, as a photo editor, photo collage has a freestyle mode that provides you with total freedom to create your artworks using any preferred layouts. Just imagine and create it! \r\n\r\nCollageArt will be your go-to photo collage maker! Relive your memories and moments with this simple but powerful Collage Maker and Photo Editor\u2764\ufe0f",
